/**
 * Core statistics from the MIN Parcel-Level Impact Analysis.
 *
 * Updated March 2026 with data through December 2025.
 * Source: 11,431 building permits (Jan 2019 – Dec 2025) in Council
 * Districts 3 and 7, enriched with OPA parcel data and L&I permit statuses.
 * Spatial join against PCPC Zoning_Overlays shapefile for MIN classification.
 *
 * Study design: within-district difference-in-differences.
 * Pre-MIN: Jan 2019 – Jul 17, 2022 (3.54 years)
 * Post-MIN: Jul 18, 2022 – Dec 31, 2025 (3.45 years)
 * Equal-length periods; annualized rates used throughout.
 *
 * RECONCILED (Aug 2026) against the City of Philadelphia 2025 Mixed Income Housing
 * Program Report: production confirmed at 19 MIN units (40% AMI). The deterrent
 * headline now uses the market-strength-MATCHED control (~450 new-construction
 * units, METHODOLOGY.md §2); the within-district trimmed-mean (~3,000) is demoted
 * to a labeled upper bound. See UNIT_LOSS.
 */

